  merged-tiling-count(n=3..8) = [2, 6, 40, 544, 16640, 1050624]
  V_merged (metagraph)        = [2, 3, 10, 34, 272, 3528]
  INTERPRETATION: the merged-tiling count is the fixed-HP-FRAME analogue
  of V_merged. Both are Burnside orbit counts under the converse/complement
  Z_2, but on DIFFERENT spaces: tilings (labeled, base-path fixed) vs
  iso classes (S_n-quotient). They are NOT equal: tiling count >> V_merged,
  because the tiling cube has NOT been quotiented by S_n relabelings.

[b] Fix_anti(phi) in FULL labeled tournament space {0,1}^C(n,2)
    phi(i)=n+1-i. Count T with T(phi u,phi v)=T(v,u).
